# NOTE: `scripts/` is deliberately NOT ignored. It was, and that was a delivery bug:
# README documents ./scripts/searxng_up.sh as a setup step and docs/RESULTS.md cites
# scripts/reason_report.py + conversion_report.py as the way to regenerate every number,
# so ignoring it shipped the results with no means of reproducing them. 144K of analysis
# code. Only its __pycache__ is ignored, via the *__pycache__* rule above.
